# The flash another alternative cost gives is that cast's alone (CR 118.9, 601.2b, 601.2f): with Omniscience and Primal Prayers
# both in play, Bot1 over Bot2's Lightning Bolt casts Harbinger of the Tides "without paying its mana cost" - and Omniscience gives
# no flash, so the Harbinger's own permission owes {2} more, paid unasked from the two Moxen, though Primal Prayers' {E} cast (which
# does give flash, and owes nothing) is on offer beside it. (Prayers itself is cast free through Omniscience, which Show and Tell
# put into play.)

